@host = http://localhost:5000

### Login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### Productos (pega el token del login)
GET {{host}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer <token>

### Almacenes con su stock total
GET {{host}}/api/warehouses
Authorization: Bearer <token>

### Stock por producto de un almacén
GET {{host}}/api/warehouses/1/stock
Authorization: Bearer <token>

### Registrar una entrada (type: In o Out)
POST {{host}}/api/movements
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "In",
  "productId": 1,
  "warehouseId": 1,
  "quantity": 20,
  "reference": "GR-0001"
}

### Movimientos desde una fecha
GET {{host}}/api/movements?from=2026-10-01T00:00:00-05:00
Authorization: Bearer <token>

### Proveedores (con cantidad de productos)
GET {{host}}/api/suppliers
Authorization: Bearer <token>

### Crear proveedor (solo Admin)
POST {{host}}/api/suppliers
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ferretería Industrial SAC",
  "ruc": "20512345678",
  "contactName": "Rosa Quispe",
  "phone": "987654321",
  "email": "ventas@ferreteria.pe",
  "address": "Av. Argentina 1234, Lima"
}

### Productos de un proveedor
GET {{host}}/api/suppliers/1/products
Authorization: Bearer <token>

### Alertas: productos bajo el stock mínimo (todos los roles)
GET {{host}}/api/alerts/low-stock
Authorization: Bearer <token>

### Alertas: solo la cantidad (indicador de la barra)
GET {{host}}/api/alerts/low-stock/count
Authorization: Bearer <token>

### Subir la foto de un producto (Admin, Almacenero). JPG, PNG o WebP, hasta 4 MB
PUT {{host}}/api/products/1/photo
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=limite

--limite
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="casco.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./casco.jpg
--limite--

### Quitar la foto
DELETE {{host}}/api/products/1/photo
Authorization: Bearer <token>

### Adjuntar la guía de remisión a un movimiento (una sola vez). PDF, JPG o PNG, hasta 4 MB
POST {{host}}/api/movements/1/document
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=limite

--limite
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="guia.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./guia.pdf
--limite--
